    "longBusinessSummary": "Digital Arts Inc. develops and markets internet security software and appliances in Japan, the United States, Europe, and the Asia Pacific. The company offers i-FILTER, a web security product; m-FILTER, a mail security product; D-SPA, a secure proxy appliance; FinalCode, a file encryption and tracking solution; DigitalArts@Cloud, a cloud security product that covers web browsing, email, and files; Desk, a chat/online conference tool; f-FILTER, a data protection and transfer solution; and StartIN, a single sign-on ID and ID management solution. It also provides security consulting services. The company was incorporated in 1995 and is headquartered in Tokyo, Japan.",
